%% FIG-021 — Manuscript change proposal lifecycle (section 12)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Proposed: Writing Agent creates diff on base revision r
  Proposed --> Proposed: citation check (CLAIM-CITATION-001)
  Proposed --> Accepted: APR-05 and current revision == r
  Proposed --> Outdated: file changed (current revision != r)
  Proposed --> Rejected: Researcher rejects
  Accepted --> [*]: new Manuscript Revision r+1, build
  Outdated --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
